STRATEGY 1 -- GREEDY (densest-core) optimality: is the densest-core+killer the MIN over coverings?
 For LRC(n) kill resonances<=n. Compare GREEDY {1..n-1}\{n-1}+lcm(n-1,n) vs alternative skip+killers:
  n=4: greedy(skip 3)=4/13=0.3077 = n/Phi_6(n)=4/13? True; min over skips=2/7(skip 2)=0.2857; greedy is min? False
  n=5: greedy(skip 4)=5/21=0.2381 = n/Phi_6(n)=5/21? True; min over skips=5/21(skip 4)=0.2381; greedy is min? True
  n=6: greedy(skip 5)=6/31=0.1935 = n/Phi_6(n)=6/31? True; min over skips=6/31(skip 5)=0.1935; greedy is min? True
  n=7: greedy(skip 6)=7/43=0.1628 = n/Phi_6(n)=7/43? True; min over skips=7/43(skip 6)=0.1628; greedy is min? True
  n=8: greedy(skip 7)=8/57=0.1404 = n/Phi_6(n)=8/57? True; min over skips=4/29(skip 6)=0.1379; greedy is min? False

